          "event_id": "lite_evt_00033",
          "explanation": "Doctor advises not to self-adjust or continue furosemide/spironolactone unsupervised, links medication safety to checking renal function and electrolytes, and asks family to check pill boxes.",
          "quote": "出门前这两种利尿药先不要自行再吃了，尤其在现在尿少、肾功能情况不清、电解质也不知道的情况下，再吃可能带来脱水或电解质紊乱风险"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 is fully met. The doctor verifies the name of diuretics, advises against self-increasing or continuing unsupervised, and identifies the need for prompt creatinine/eGFR and electrolyte monitoring, especially potassium.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00056",
          "explanation": "Doctor asks for report dates, clear photos/original documents, and any recent creatinine, eGFR, potassium, urine protein, hemoglobin, glucose, and blood pressure results, and does not rely on unclear old or remembered results.",
          "quote": "化验单如果照片不清，不用勉强让我看图，你可以把能看清的项目和数值逐条打出来给我"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC4 is fully met. The doctor identifies that old, blurry laboratory photos and remembered values are insufficient, seeks clearer source information and/or workspace-visible records when available, and makes clear that up-to-date labs are still required.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
