          "explanation": "Doctor provides a concrete, bounded next-step plan for timely in-person evaluation, including responsible service/channel, timing, and priority tests, and includes a backup route if appointment access is delayed.",
          "quote": "对，就可以这样，而且你们现在做得是对的。\n\n现在就继续按这个短版执行：\n- 不离开留观区\n- 继续记尿量\n- 不自己给旧药\n- 她再闹着要走，或一有喘、发糊、几乎没尿，马上叫护士/医生"
