      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC5",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00004",
          "explanation": "Doctor defines clear emergency triggers during waiting or if symptoms worsen, including near-anuria, dyspnea, chest tightness, palpitations, confusion, and severe weakness.",
          "quote": "先帮我判断是不是要马上去急诊：现在有没有气短、平躺喘、胸闷胸痛、明显乏力或嗜睡、恶心呕吐、意识发糊，或者一天尿特别少？如果有这些，今天就去急诊。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC6 is fully met. The doctor defines clear emergency triggers tailored to CKD, oliguria, edema, and potassium/volume risks, and instructs that red flags override routine appointment plans.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6",
      "status": "met"
